---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Areas We Serve
description: PrimeTurf installs artificial turf across Gauteng — Sandton, Hyde Park, Pretoria East, Centurion, Edenvale, Boksburg — and in Cape Town and surrounds.
eyebrow: Areas
heading: Gauteng and the Western Cape.
lede: Same-day site visits available across Gauteng. Cape Town and surrounds by appointment.
breadcrumbs:
  - label: Areas
---
<section class="section section--flush-top">
  <div class="wrap">
    {% for region, info in regions %}
    <div class="region" data-reveal>
      <header class="region__head">
        <h2 class="display-m">{{ region }}</h2>
        <p class="mono">{{ info.climate }}</p>
      </header>
      <ul class="area-grid">
        {% for l in locations | where("region", region) %}
        <li><a class="area-card" href="/areas/{{ l.slug }}/"><span class="area-card__name">{{ l.name }}</span><span class="area-card__coord mono">{{ (l.lat * -1) | round(3) }}° S · {{ l.lng | round(3) }}° E</span><span class="area-card__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
